  "description": "Erencia Nobelita has been killed and reborn three times, each life ending in tragedy no matter how righteous she tries to be. So she throws caution aside in her fourth loop and decides to live selfishly, but every “evil” choice only wins her admiration and praise. Frustrated and desperate, she sets her sights on Euclid Grethelos, the empire’s most adored Grand Duke, and boldly asks for his hand in marriage. But instead of ruining her life, her audacious plan may have just set the stage for a fate far more unexpected… and irresistible. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
